      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Strong –  Having a mass-production batch completed and in transit is a significant positive. The timeline is relatively clear, though dependent on software updates.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Simple – Direct sales model.  The lack of subscriptions is a benefit.",
      "Differentiation": "• Moderate – While the ‘no apps’ approach is a differentiator, it faces competition from existing sleep apps and devices. The sunrise lighting and progressive alarm are common features.",
